bt_test

Extracted from Radxa's `aicrf-test` package, shipped inside the official
Radxa Cubie A5E image (/usr/bin/bt_test).

Copyright: Radxa Computer Co., Ltd
Upstream:  https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800
License:   GPL-3+ (as declared by the Radxa packaging)

Full license text: ../../LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt
Packaging copyright: aicrf-test.copyright (same directory)

Note: this binary is not required by the shipped configuration. Bluetooth
comes up with plain `hciattach -s 1500000 /dev/ttyAS1 any 1500000 flow nosleep`
(see scripts/board/aic8800-bt-up related work). It is kept only as a
reference/test tool.
